 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two verbs for «to go»",
     "texto": [
      "For a specific journey in one direction, **идти** is used when going on foot and **ехать** when travelling by land transport (car, bus, metro or train). For flying, another verb is used. Regular or repeated journeys use other verbs.",
      "**Я иду в магазин** = I walk to the shop. **Я еду в Москву** = I travel to Moscow by land.",
      "With trains, **идти** is also used when talking about the timetable: **Поезд идёт в десять часов** = the train leaves at ten o'clock."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "«Идти» and «ехать»",
