    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Where to: в and на + accusative",
     "texto": [
      "For the destination you ask **Куда?** (where to?) and answer with **в** or **на**, but now with the **accusative**: feminine nouns change -а to **-у**.",
      "Compare. **Где?** – в школ**е** (at school). **Куда?** – в школ**у** (to school).",
      "в магазин (to the shop), в центр (to the centre), в Москв**у** (to Moscow), на работ**у** (to work).",
      "«Home» has its own word: **домой**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Where and where to",
     "columnas": [
